WEBVTT

00:11:00.329 --> 00:11:04.746
And not very many people knew about it
and everyone was upset about that.

00:11:04.746 --> 00:11:08.579
And I guess it's just like in regular
relationships and you talk about

00:11:08.579 --> 00:11:10.329
the honeymoon phase, you always say, oh,

00:11:10.329 --> 00:11:14.787
there were all these red flags and
you're just like, oh, well,

00:11:14.787 --> 00:11:18.829
I just I couldn't see them because
I was just so blinded by love.

00:11:19.162 --> 00:11:20.871
It's kind of the same thing.

00:11:21.496 --> 00:11:22.829
A few months into the job,

00:11:22.829 --> 00:11:25.871
Janice had some concerns and she
heard other people complaining,

00:11:26.121 --> 00:11:28.037
but she didn't feel that
she could speak up.

00:11:29.079 --> 00:11:32.037
She also felt that the company had
a serious lack of diversity,